      "content": "that's a great start. it sounds really academic. can you expand on that a bit? specifically, could you add some sentences that elaborate on why the opposing faction's views are so inherently flawed and irrational compared to the protagonist's perspective? i want to make sure the reader understands why their stance is basically just a defense of the old, broken status quo.",
